# Build context hygiene for `docker build .` and Hugging Face Spaces.
#
# `COPY package*.json ./` + `npm install` inside the image is what provides the
# dependencies; a host `node_modules` copied over it would be the wrong platform
# (and can break `socket.io`'s native-free but still arch-specific build).
node_modules
# Vercel's build output is regenerated by `npm run build`; the image serves the
# source tree, and `server.js` falls back to public/ on its own.
dist
# Never bake local secrets into an image layer.
.env
.env.*
# Git metadata, editor and OS noise.
.git
.gitignore
.vercel
.DS_Store
*.log
# Generated test fixtures.
tests/app
